{"lines": ["Two children were found beside a wolf pit in England. Their skin was green. And they spoke no language anyone knew.", "Woolpit, Suffolk, twelfth century. Reapers find a brother and sister.", "Strange clothes. Green skin. They refuse all food.", "For days they eat nothing. Then someone shows them raw broad beans. They devour them.", "Slowly they learn English. Slowly the green fades. But the boy grows sick, and dies.", "The girl lives. And she finally tells her story.", "A land called Saint Martin, where the sun never shone. They heard bells, and walked through a cave.", "Two monks wrote this down. Neither could explain it.", "Some say Flemish orphans with a sickness. Others, a folktale. Others, visitors from elsewhere.", "So where did those children really come from? Tell me below."], "words": [["Two", 0.0, 0.12], ["children", 0.12, 0.5], ["were", 0.5, 0.8], ["found", 0.8, 1.14], ["beside", 1.14, 1.56], ["a", 1.56, 1.78], ["wolf", 1.78, 1.98], ["pit", 1.98, 2.32], ["in", 2.32, 2.7], ["England.", 2.7, 3.02], ["Their", 3.8, 4.02], ["skin", 4.02, 4.3], ["was", 4.3, 4.82], ["green.", 4.82, 5.14], ["And", 5.14, 5.9], ["they", 5.9, 6.02], ["spoke", 6.02, 6.26], ["no", 6.26, 6.58], ["language", 6.58, 6.96], ["anyone", 6.96, 7.5], ["knew.", 7.5, 7.96], ["Woolpit,", 8.74, 9.0], ["Suffolk,", 9.18, 9.36], ["twelfth", 10.0, 10.7], ["century.", 10.7, 10.74], ["Reapers", 11.16, 11.56], ["find", 11.56, 11.92], ["a", 11.92, 12.1], ["brother", 12.1, 12.32], ["and", 12.32, 12.64], ["sister.", 12.64, 12.94], ["Strange", 13.7, 13.98], ["clothes.", 13.98, 14.48], ["Green", 15.26, 15.38], ["skin.", 15.38, 15.8], ["They", 16.34, 16.56], ["refuse", 16.56, 16.94], ["all", 16.94, 17.36], ["food.", 17.36, 17.76], ["For", 18.516, 18.6], ["days", 18.6, 18.84], ["they", 18.84, 19.24], ["eat", 19.24, 19.46], ["nothing.", 19.46, 19.78], ["Then", 20.58, 20.62], ["someone", 20.62, 20.88], ["shows", 20.88, 21.32], ["them", 21.32, 21.6], ["raw", 21.6, 21.82], ["broad", 21.82, 22.18], ["bea